msgctxt "240"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Get at least 1,500 points in a Normal Game!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"(At least 1,500 points in a Normal Game... One play is 300 yen. Should I "
"give it a try?)"
msgstr ""
"(Almeno 2.600 punti in una partita Difficile... Una giocata costa 300 yen. "
"Ci provo?)"

msgctxt "264"
msgid "(Okay, I'll try it.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Good luck, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Buona fortuna, zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "300"
msgid "(No, maybe not.)"
msgstr "(O forse no.)"

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Aww! You should play!"
msgstr "Dai! Dovresti giocare!"

msgctxt "324"
msgid "(One Normal Game is 300 yen, but I don't have enough money...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Aww! You should play!"
msgstr "Dai! Dovresti giocare!"

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"In this game, there are three home run targets. Every target awards the same"
" amount of points. Once a target is hit, you cannot hit it again until you "
"hit all of the remaining targets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Aim by moving the cursor to where you want the ball to go. Use the "
"<Action:Button_LS_Up@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Down@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Left@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Right@Battingcenter>"
" to move the cursor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Once you hit all the targets, a bonus target will appear. However, you only "
"get one chance to hit it. The bonus target disappears after one pitch, "
"whether you hit it or not. Aim carefully and go for a new high score!"
msgstr ""
"Una volta che hai colpito tutti i bersagli, spunterà un bersaglio bonus. "
"Però, hai solo una chance per centrarlo. Il bersaglio bonus svanisce dopo un"
" solo lancio, che tu l'abbia beccato o meno. Mira con attenzione e punta a "
"un nuovo record!"

msgctxt "396"
msgid "(Hmm... The Normal Game is 300 yen. Maybe I should give it a try.)"
msgstr "(Hmm... Il Gioco Normale costa 300 yen. Magari potrei provarci.)"

msgctxt "408"
msgid "(Okay, I'll try it.)"
msgstr ""

